**先呼叫三個工具，依序取得所需資訊：**

```json
{
  "name": "predict_house_price",
  "arguments": {
    "area": 2000,
    "rooms": 4,
    "year": 1985,
    "location": "San Francisco"
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "name": "lawsuit_search",
  "arguments": {
    "entity": "John Doe",
    "county": "San Francisco",
    "state": "California"
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "name": "calculate_probability",
  "arguments": {
    "total_outcomes": 1000,
    "favorable_outcomes": 5,
    "round_to": 3
  }
}
```

**等候工具回傳後，我將把三個結果整合成最終回覆給您。**
